      "mergedPostDetails": "This is an extremely consistent bug for me, that I cannot see but am constantly asked about. Every single instance im in no matter what world it is, no matter how many people are in it no matter how new the instance is or how long anybody else has been there, after about 20 or 30 minutes of myself being in ANY instance no matter the conditions, my IK for everybody will update at low framerates. the only thing i can do to fix this is rejoining the instance but then after 20 more minutes my IK will be seen as this choppy low frame mess. I am constantly asked about it and constantly having it mentioned to me by everyone I am around, a long time ago I had this bug but it was fixed, and i cannot remember if it was before networked IK or not when i had this bug last. and im not sure when this started appearing for me again either. here is a video of it https://streamable.com/8s6k0a\n\nI remember tupper mentioning a long time ago that this really rare bug happened to one other person he knew of, I sent him my logs and he looked into it, although that was a long time ago and I feel like that is irrelevant now, however\nI have heard from some friends that this specific bug has happened for at least 1 or 2 other people in our big circle of friends, although I myself have yet to see this bug in action on anybody else.\nI have very stable internet\nmore stable than people who have more consistent tracking and worse internet, so internet cannot be a problem so I am not sure what can possibly be causing this.\n\nand no it is not a shader pelase stop asking me this you mean mean mean unfunny people",
