      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "This is consistent for me since the update.  Every world no matter how many players after 10-20 minutes, players movements get jerky.  And it seems like it might get worse the longer I stay?  Some players seem more jerky than others to me, but it might depend on how long they've been in the world?  If you need a guinea pig, it seems to be consistent for me 100% of the time in all worlds with other peoples movements.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
