      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{5acad9ecc9dba010c9c3ec68|full_name}: \nI observed the same issue with IK slides in build 1114.\nThe drop frames seem to be less than in the previous version, but the movement of certain players from everyone present becomes jerky, and smooths out when the player reenters the world.",
